The MIT License above covers the code (core/, scripts/, tests/, and each event's
event.json and build setup). It does not cover:

- Event data (events/*/data/): timetables come from each festival's official
  announcements; artist bios are summaries written for this project from the
  public sources listed with each bio. Festival and artist names belong to
  their owners. This is an unofficial tool.
